{
  "_comment": [
    "The single list of what the public viewer may show.",
    "engine_keys: the only key names the engine may borrow from another install's .env (--keys-from).",
    "aprs_listen: one listen-only APRS-IS region (max 500 km). Nothing is ever sent.",
    "engine_layers: fetcher switches forced on the public engine at start.",
    "keys: top-level data keys the bridge may publish. Anything not listed, or",
    "listed with public=false, never leaves the engine machine.",
    "Change a verdict here and restart the engine and bridge; nothing else."
